<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 5 Best in Slot Gear list for Elemental Shaman DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a>. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, BoE World drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h2>Elemental <a class="icontiny c7" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/shaman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_shaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shaman</span></a> Tier 10 set has a good set bonus in <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=70811/item-shaman-t10-elemental-2p-bonus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_misc_emotionhappy.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Shaman T10 Elemental 2P Bonus</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=70817/item-shaman-t10-elemental-4p-bonus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_misc_emotionhappy.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Shaman T10 Elemental 4P Bonus</span></a> but, more importantly, can be obtained at item level 277 and has great stats overall, making it an excellent investment for the pieces alone, with the set bonuses being the cherry on top.<br/>
<br/>While gearing up, remember that you can also use <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/armor/min-level:232/side:2/class:7/weights:250:249:248:247:123:119:103:96:23/weight-values:63.333:63.333:63.333:100:3.333:3.333:3.333:3.333:0.567?filter=123:24:238:86;1:3:4:11;0:0:4:0#items">crafted gear</a> to fill in for any weaker gear slots!<br/>
