<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h3>
<span class="socket-meta q0"></span>
<b>Meta sockets</b> are unique to head slot pieces and accept meta gems (instead of regular gems). Only a single meta socket may exist in any given piece, and many pieces come without a meta socket at all.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41285/chaotic-skyflare-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chaotic Skyflare Diamond</span></a> is the best meta gem, especially once you have good gear, as it acts as a multiplier on your damage output.<br/>
<br/>The best helmet option is the highest item level Tier 10 head piece you can obtain. As you need the previous piece in order to be able to upgrade it to higher item level, you will eventually have went through all Tier 10 head options to reach the maximum item level one, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51237/sanctified-frost-witchs-helm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_169.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Frost Witch's Helm</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48328/thralls-helm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thrall's Helm of Triumph</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48323/nobundos-helm-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nobundo's Helm of Triumph</span></a> are also good helmets with strong stats and which enable the Tier 9 bonuses.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44159/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
