<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulder for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h3>The shoulder slot has the <b>best off-tier piece</b> in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50698/horrific-flesh-epaulets">
