<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51248/sanctified-frost-witchs-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_104.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Frost Witch's Handguards</span></a> and its lower item level versions are the best gloves available, as they have both great stats and contribute towards your Tier 10 bonuses. You can find other <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> and equivalent item level gloves in this <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/armor/min-level:264/side:2/class:7/slot:10/weights:250:249:248:247:123:119:103:96:23/weight-values:63.333:63.333:63.333:100:3.333:3.333:3.333:3.333:0.567?filter=123:24:238:79:61;1:3:4:3:3;0:0:4:0:0">Wowhead glove armor link</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48324/nobundos-gloves-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nobundo's Gloves of Triumph</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48327/thralls-gloves-of-triumph">
