<br/>The crafted <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49891/leggings-of-woven-death">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_34.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Woven Death</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49900/lightning-infused-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_mail_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning-Infused Leggings</span></a> are also great options if you can afford them, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47190/legwraps-of-the-awakening">
