<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h2>Staves and other two-handed weapons generally grant less total spell damage than a MH+OH combo, and also lack the extra armor and block a shield provides, making a MH+OH generally superior if its stats are comparable to the best two-handed weapon available.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-elemental-shaman-dps-in-phase-5">Weapons for Elemental Shaman DPS in Phase 5</h4>
