<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> weapons are also fairly strong, and they can be found within this <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/weapons/min-level:264/class:7/slot:21:13/weights:250:249:248:247:123:119:103:96:23/weight-values:63.333:63.333:63.333:100:3.333:3.333:3.333:3.333:0.567?filter=123:24:238:79;1:3:4:3;0:0:4:0#items">Wowhead weapon gear link</a>.<br/>
